  "result": "Fixed in `src/click/core.py` (`Context.__init__`). A subcommand's context was inheriting the parent's whole `default_map` instead of the entry for its own name, so a map like `{\"sub\": {\"opt\": 1}}` never reached `sub`'s options.\n\nThe change is one line: `default_map = parent.default_map.get(info_name)`.\n\nThe existing test suite passes: 1906 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed. I did not add a new regression test for the nested-subcommand case.",
